      "scale": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "These strange pages contain shreds of lost lore from mages long since past. If I study them carefully at a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Study Desk",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", I can apply my own experiences to the writings and gain more proficiency with the spells these fragments mention.  These fragments may even allow me to learn spells I wouldn't otherwise be able to, for example "
        },
        {
          "text": "ones from other factions",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  I should be careful when casting them all the same though, lest I draw the ire of the factions down upon me.\n\nIn order to make such a Study Desk, I will need slightly more than a basic grasp of magical theory.\n\nI can probably also study the lost "
        },
        {
          "text": "Staves, Wands, and Bangles ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "That I've found in some of the ancient structures around the world in a similar manner as well, though probably to an overall lesser effect."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "manaweaving_altar",
      "location": "mna:manaweaving/artifice/study_desk"
    }
  ]
}